Attribution of adopted concepts (BRIEF.md §2)

This repository adopts concepts owned by other documents, by pinned citation and
conformance test rather than by restatement. `concepts/*.yaml` records the owner,
document, section, commit and content hash for each. Those owners are named there and
in BRIEF.md §1; nothing in this repository restates their definitions, and no code from
any of them is vendored or imported in either direction.

The verbatim excerpts that once backed those citations are not part of this repository's
history (decision D0176). A citation resolves here to a pinned hash; anyone holding the
owner's document at the pinned commit can verify the pin. `concepts/snapshots/` retains
only this project's own excerpt of its own BRIEF.
